00:18:45.701 --> 00:18:48.490
then you add its successors
to the waitlist, basically.

00:18:48.491 --> 00:18:50.970
That's what it does
all the time until

00:18:50.971 --> 00:18:52.880
it finds a target node, right?

00:18:52.881 --> 00:18:57.960
So in this case the red node,
